WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:09.928
The network budget pays operating fees, such as sending device
reports. It is separate from your subscription device limit.
Choose Network budget in the sidebar.

2
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:19.621
Enter a deposit in SUI. Devices use these operating funds within
your limits. File and log storage has separate funding controls.

3
00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:25.501
Approve the deposit in your wallet. A budget is created only if
your fleet needs one.

4
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:34.581
Confirmed. The balance under Keep devices reporting shows the
confirmed deposit. Device readiness and health are checked
separately.

